   "source": [
    "## CONCEPT: Make new columns (feature creation)\n",
    "\n",
    "- A new column is made like a dictionary: `df[\"new\"] = ...`.\n",
    "- You can use maths on other columns: `df[\"total\"] = df[\"maths\"] + df[\"english\"]`.\n",
    "- The maths runs on every row at once. No loop.\n",
    "- A new useful column is called a **feature**. AI models learn from features."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-32",
   "metadata": {},
